# Cloudflare Pages cache policy (see README → Deploy).
# Everything is revalidated on every load except the framework files, whose names carry a content hash
# and can therefore be cached forever. "! Cache-Control" detaches the generic rule before overriding it.
/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/_framework/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
